Package: streamcrack
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: WPA2 Wi-Fi password auditing and recovery tool
 StreamCrack is an offline WPA2 Wi-Fi password auditing and recovery tool.
 It inspects local PCAP/PCAPNG capture files for metadata, extracts WPA2
 4-way handshakes, and performs authorized offline PSK recovery
 (dictionary or mask cracking) against captured handshakes. It features a
 keyboard-driven terminal interface and does not perform live capture,
 packet injection, or deauthentication.
